<mxCell id="diagram-title" value="DGM-STATE-02 v0.2.1 Draft | Sprint, task, allocation and blocker state projections | 18 October 2026 | Sources: DGM-DESIGN-01 v0.1; PRD-01 v0.9; UC-02 v0.8; SAD-03 v0.17; DATA-04 v0.16.1; ADR-0008; ADR-0012; ADR-0014; ADR-0018" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;align=left;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;spacing=12;"><mxGeometry x="30" y="15" width="1840" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="diagram-scope" value="Independent state domains coordinated by one Workspace transaction for completion/reopen. No Sprint reopening. Current location is persisted independently of completed allocation history.&lt;br/&gt;One Active Sprint per project; at most one live allocation per task. Completed allocation history and blocker events are preserved. Capability + expected revision + idempotency + audit required." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;spacing=12;"><mxGeometry x="30" y="125" width="1840" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
